        },
        {
          "name": "Clusters are computed by vex index and carried, frozen, across vex update. After an update the JSON has stale",
          "description": "true and new_since_build, and text output ends with a ! line; run vex index to recompute. This is separate from _meta.vex.dev/stale, which still means \"index older than the working tree\".",
